      "Title": "Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">The result of executing an <xref href=\"System.Func%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. Contains properties indicating whether the operation\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result.Succeeded\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> or <xref href=\"Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result.Failed\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>. If the operation failed the\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result.ErrorMessage\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> property will contain a message as to why. If the operation succeeded the\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.TryPattern.Result%601.Value\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> property will contain the return value from the function.</p>\n"
    },
